I can help you get organized and prepared for the preliminary hearing and possible trial. Below I’ve put together (A) a short prep checklist of what to tell your attorney at your next conversation, (B) a prioritized list of specific questions to ask Michael Torres, (C) the documents/evidence you should gather now, (D) practical steps to get evidence trial-ready, and (E) a short sample email you can send to your lawyer (I can draft/send it if you want).

